          "zh_cn": "虚空幻觉已修正：临时隐藏的方块会保留状态与容器内容，恢复不会复制物品。",
          "en_us": "Void-fall illusions preserve the states and inventory contents of temporarily hidden blocks, without duplicating items on restoration."
